        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. One-Lane Bridge Synchronization",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Problem",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A bridge can accommodate a maximum of 3 vehicles simultaneously. Vehicles from East and West directions cannot be on the bridge at the same time.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Create one thread for each vehicle.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Sample Input",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Number of vehicles: 6",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Vehicle Direction\nV1 East\nV2 East\nV3 West\nV4 East\nV5 West\nV6 West",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Sample Output",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "V1 entered the bridge from East\nV2 entered the bridge from East\nV4 entered the bridge from East",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "V1 exited the bridge\nV2 exited the bridge\nV4 exited the bridge",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "V3 entered the bridge from West\nV5 entered the bridge from West\nV6 entered the bridge from West",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "All vehicles crossed successfully.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Students must use",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_create() – Create one thread for each vehicle.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_join() – Wait for all vehicle threads.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_mutex_t – Protect shared bridge variables.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_cond_t – Make vehicles wait when the bridge cannot be entered.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "Shared variables:",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "vehicles_on_bridge",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "current_direction",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_cond_wait() – Wait if:",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "Bridge already has 3 vehicles.",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "Vehicles from the opposite direction are crossing.",
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "page",
      "number": 2,
      "title": null,
      "images": 0,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_cond_broadcast() – Notify waiting vehicles when the bridge becomes available.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Airport Runway Allocation",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Problem",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "An airport has 2 runways. Multiple aircraft request permission to land.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Emergency aircraft should be given priority over normal aircraft.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Sample Input",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Number of aircraft: 5\nNumber of runways: 2",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Aircraft Type\nA1 Normal\nA2 Emergency\nA3 Normal\nA4 Emergency\nA5 Normal",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Sample Output",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A2 (Emergency) assigned Runway 1\nA4 (Emergency) assigned Runway 2",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A2 completed landing and released Runway 1\nA1 assigned Runway 1",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A4 completed landing and released Runway 2\nA3 assigned Runway 2",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "All aircraft landed successfully.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Students must use",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_create() – One thread per aircraft.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_mutex_t – Protect runway availability.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_cond_t – Separate condition variables for:",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "Emergency aircraft",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "Normal aircraft",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "Shared variables:",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "available_runways",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "waiting_emergency",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "waiting_normal",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_cond_wait() – Aircraft waits when no runway is available.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_cond_signal() or pthread_cond_broadcast() – Notify waiting aircraft.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "Priority logic:",
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "page",
      "number": 3,
      "title": null,
      "images": 0,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "Normal aircraft should wait if an emergency aircraft is waiting.",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Parking Lot Management",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Problem",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A parking lot has 3 parking spaces and 5 cars. A car must wait if the parking lot is full.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Sample Input",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Parking slots: 3\nNumber of cars: 5",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Sample Output",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Car 1 entered. Available slots: 2\nCar 2 entered. Available slots: 1\nCar 3 entered. Available slots: 0",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Car 4 is waiting\nCar 5 is waiting",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Car 2 left the parking lot\nCar 4 entered. Available slots: 0",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Car 1 left the parking lot\nCar 5 entered. Available slots: 0",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Students must use",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_create() – One thread for each car.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_mutex_t – Protect the parking slot count.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "One pthread_cond_t – For waiting cars.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "Shared variable:",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "available_slots",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_cond_wait() – When available_slots == 0.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_cond_signal() – When a car leaves and releases a slot.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "list_item",
          "text": "pthread_join() – Wait for all cars.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. Elevator Capacity Control",
