        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "5. Railway Junction Synchronization",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Problem",
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Trains arrive from Track A and Track B. Only one train can use the railway junction at a time.",
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "page",
      "number": 5,
      "title": null,
      "images": 0,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The solution should ensure that trains from one track do not permanently block trains from the other track.",
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
